      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture of the test. I'll write an improved version with better variable names, a descriptive test method name, removed unused imports, and a clarifying reference to `UNSET_MAX_WIDTH`.The improved test compiled successfully (`COMPILE_OK`). The refactored version improves understandability by removing the unused `CharBuffer` import, renaming the test method to `test_setScalable_enablesScalingAndPreservesDefaultUnsetMaxWidth`, using clearer variable names (`builder` and `sameBuilder` instead of `textStyle_Builder0`/`textStyle_Builder1`), and adding a Javadoc comment explaining the intent and the fluent-builder relationship between the two references."
